▽_authored ▷AUTHOR
FieldNotes
Named FieldNotes, it takes no arguments and returns the name of every creature it recorded, one name on each line. It takes the lines of CreatureTable, sets aside the header line, and for each remaining line reads three comma separated fields: the creature name, its habitat and a trait. For each line it asks the model for one sentence about that creature and hands the creature name and that sentence to Remember.
